          "settings": {
            "heading": "About these terms",
            "text": "<p>These terms are an agreement between you and <strong>CC Lab Technology Holding Limited</strong>, Merchants House, 27–30 Merchant's Quay, Dublin 8, Ireland (“we”, “us”). They apply to the Toothfairy® AI app and this website. By using the app you accept them.</p><p>Because you download the app from the App Store, Apple's Licensed Application End User License Agreement also applies. If these terms and Apple's differ, these terms apply as far as the law allows.</p>"
