          "type": "part",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Toothfairy® AI is — and isn't",
            "text": "<p>Toothfairy® AI creates simulated previews of an enhanced smile from a photo, for <strong>visualisation and inspiration only</strong>.</p><p>Previews and videos are not medical, dental or orthodontic advice, not a diagnosis and not a treatment plan. Real results depend on your teeth and the treatment you choose, and are never guaranteed. Always consult a qualified dental professional before deciding on treatment.</p>"
