            "text": "<ul><li>Only use photos of yourself, or of someone who has given you permission.</li><li>Don't upload photos of children unless you are their parent or guardian.</li><li>Don't upload unlawful, offensive or misleading content.</li><li>You keep all rights to your photos. You allow us to process them only to create the result you asked for (see our <a href=\"/pages/privacy\">privacy policy</a>).</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "part_4": {
          "type": "part",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Credits and payments",
            "text": "<ul><li>The app is free to download. Previews and videos use credits, bought in the app through Apple.</li><li>Prices are shown in the app before you buy. The credits a preview or video uses are shown before you confirm.</li><li>Credits don't expire and are not a subscription. They can't be exchanged for money or transferred to another account.</li><li>Purchases are handled by Apple and follow the App Store's refund rules. You can request a refund at <a href=\"https://reportaproblem.apple.com\">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</li><li>If a generation clearly fails, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@toothfairy.app\">support@toothfairy.app</a> and we'll look into it and restore the credit.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "part_5": {
          "type": "part",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Clinic introductions",
            "text": "<p>If you ask, we can put you in touch with a partner clinic or doctor from our network. Partner clinics are independent professionals: they are responsible for any consultation, advice and treatment they provide, and their own terms and prices apply.</p><p>Practices that join the network do so under a separate partner agreement.</p>"
