            "text": "<p>Nothing in these terms limits your rights as a consumer under the law of your country, or our liability where it cannot be limited by law.</p><p>Within those limits, we are not responsible for decisions you or anyone else make based on a simulated preview, or for the advice and treatment of independent clinics.</p>"
